{'symbol': 'ICE', 'date': '2023-03-07 09:00:00', 'title': "BLACK KNIGHT AND INTERCONTINENTAL EXCHANGE ANNOUNCE AGREEMENT TO SELL BLACK KNIGHT'S EMPOWER LOS BUSINESS TO CONSTELLATION SOFTWARE INC. AND REVISED TERMS OF MERGER AGREEMENT", 'text': "ATLANTA & NEW YORK & JACKSONVILLE, FLA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--INTERCONTINENTAL EXCHANGE, INC. (NYSE: ICE) AND BLACK KNIGHT, INC. (NYSE: BKI) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT, IN CONNECTION WITH THEIR PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED MERGER AGREEMENT FOR ICE'S ACQUISITION OF BLACK KNIGHT, THEY HAVE AGREED TO SELL BLACK KNIGHT'S EMPOWER LOAN ORIGINATION SYSTEM (LOS) BUSINESS, INCLUDING ITS EXCHANGE, LENDINGSPACE AND AIVA SOLUTIONS, TO A SUBSIDIARY OF CONSTELLATION SOFTWARE INC. (TSX: CSU)."}